% What lesson 20's access policy should say, as far as anyone has
% written it down (lesson 27).  A fact must be derived; `:- fact.`
% must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/access-draft.dl --expect programs/access.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/access.dl --expect programs/access.expect

can(alice, delete, roadmap).     % she owns it
can(alice, edit, roadmap).       % ...and owners edit
can(carol, view, handbook).      % granted to contractors
can(bob, view, roadmap).         % sales is staff; staff view the company folder
:- can(alice, delete, company).  % owning a document is not owning its folder
:- can(carol, view, roadmap).    % contractors see the handbook only
:- can(eng, A, O).               % groups are not people
:- allowed(bob, A, O).           % bob is suspended
